COMPILATION OF: E51E

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51E

   1 a 0000 E51E:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] CHAINED DIVISION z = a / b / c (left-associative
   4 a 0006      (a/b)/c).  DEC chaining is accepted (NG17) but DEC scale laws
   5 a 0006      do not transfer to binary.  If DIV-chain feeding keeps the
   6 a 0006      quotient in HL across the next parking, H-E-push predicts two
   7 a 0006      ID22N calls with NO store between them; H-E-store predicts
   8 a 0006      SHLD z then LHLD z between the calls.  H-E-refuse: a DR binary
   9 a 0006      boundary. */
  10 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  11 c 0006   z = a / b / c;
  12 a 001C end E51E;

CODE SIZE = 001F
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38BC
END  COMPILATION
